Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "salary": 55000
}

###

DELETE {{EmployeeApi_HostAddress}}/api/employee/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

